<main class="gg-page">
  <section class="gg-subpage-hero">
    <p class="gg-eyebrow">Support Goal Grower</p>
    <h1>Help a student-built app keep growing.</h1>
    <p>
      Goal Grower is being built by three college students. Your support helps
      fund testing, publishing, design, development, and future features.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="gg-fund">
    <div>
      <p class="gg-eyebrow">Where support goes</p>
      <h2>Funding the next version.</h2>
      <p>
        This project is still small. Support helps us keep building, testing,
        improving, and preparing Goal Grower for launch.
      </p>
      <a href="/pages/goal-grower-store" class="gg-btn gg-btn-light">Shop to support</a>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-fund-card">
      <h3>Support helps with</h3>
      <div><span>01</span><p>App store and testing costs</p></div>
      <div><span>02</span><p>Design improvements and screenshots</p></div>
      <div><span>03</span><p>Shared garden features</p></div>
      <div><span>04</span><p>Development tools and launch work</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="gg-support-options">
    <div class="gg-section-heading">
      <p class="gg-eyebrow">Ways to support</p>
      <h2>Choose what works for you.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-store-grid">
      <a href="/pages/contact#testing" class="gg-product-card">
        <div class="gg-product-image"></div>
        <span>Free</span>
        <h3>Become a beta tester</h3>
        <p>Try the app, give feedback, and help us improve before launch.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/pages/goal-grower-store" class="gg-product-card">
        <div class="gg-product-image"></div>
        <span>Store</span>
        <h3>Buy from the store</h3>
        <p>Merch and small products help fund development.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/pages/contact" class="gg-product-card">
        <div class="gg-product-image"></div>
        <span>Feedback</span>
        <h3>Send ideas</h3>
        <p>Feature ideas, bugs, and honest feedback help shape the app.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="gg-faq">
    <div class="gg-section-heading">
      <p class="gg-eyebrow">Support FAQ</p>
      <h2>What support does and does not mean.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-faq-list">
      <details>
        <summary>Does support guarantee a reward?</summary>
        <p>No. Support helps development, but it does not guarantee a specific reward, timeline, or feature.</p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>Do store purchases support development?</summary>
        <p>Yes. Store purchases help fund the project after product, platform, and operating costs.</p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>Can I support without buying?</summary>
        <p>Yes. Joining the beta list, giving feedback, and sharing the project all help.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Goal Grower Support",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Goal Grower Support"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}